olari was again in the lead and slowly established an advantage over his followers.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":42,"text":"On lap 42, Nuvolari was again in the lead and slowly established an advantage over his followers.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":48,"text":"Several cars had made pit stops for tires and fuel, including the leading group, causing front runners to fall back. Consequently Borzacchini found himself in first place","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":48,"text":"Several cars had made pit stops for tires and fuel, including the leading group, causing front runners to fall back. Consequently Borzacchini found himself in first place","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":51,"text":"Borzacchini leaves the lead and pits; his car is retired with a broken wheel hub.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":51,"text":"Borzacchini leaves the lead and pits; his car is retired with a broken wheel hub.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":52,"text":"Nuvolari stopped on lap 52 for 1m57s to change four wheels, refuel and get a refreshing drink during this hot race.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":52,"text":"Nuvolari stopped on lap 52 for 1m57s to change four wheels, refuel and get a refreshing drink during this hot race.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":56,"text":"Dreyfus, the great hope of the large crowd, lost a wheel on lap 56 at a speed of 200 km/h. Only by pure luck did the driver escape a serious accident.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":56,"text":"Dreyfus, the great hope of the large crowd, lost a wheel on lap 56 at a speed of 200 km/h. Only by pure luck did the driver escape a serious accident.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":60,"text":"Nuvolari catches Fagioli; Moll is close behind, Chiron 35 seconds further back. Zehender hands over to Parenti.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":60,"text":"Nuvolari catches Fagioli; Moll is close behind, Chiron 35 seconds further back. Zehender hands over to Parenti.","q":f